# Context filter for the CI image build (ci/Containerfile).
# The repo root .dockerignore excludes pixi.toml/pixi.lock (fine for the
# exporter images) — this per-Containerfile ignore re-includes exactly what
# the CI image needs and keeps heavy local dirs out of the build context.
*
!ci/
!ci/Containerfile
!pixi.toml
!pixi.lock
!.pre-commit-config.yaml
!README.md
